    {
        "text": "...Aaargh!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_107_liskam_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "All clear!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liskarm"
    },
    {
        "text": "Confirming that it's safe over here!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liskarm"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_106_franka_1",
        "name2": "char_107_liskam_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Where's the enemy commander?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_106_franka_1",
        "name2": "char_107_liskam_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...Not with their main force.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liskarm"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_106_franka_1",
        "name2": "char_107_liskam_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The enemy is lurking... we're being followed and watched.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are they trying to wear us down until they have the perfect opportunity to strike?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_106_franka_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Reunion is no stranger to sneak attacks.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "We learned this the hard way at Chernobog.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's fall back quickly...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_107_liskam_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I can't guarantee the safety of the escape route.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liskarm"
    },
    {
        "text": "We'll be in danger if they start demolishing the nearby buildings to block the road.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liskarm"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_107_liskam_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hurry, let's see what other routes we can take. The stealthier, the better!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_107_liskam_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Amiya, how about taking that staircase to our 4 o'clock down?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liskarm"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_106_franka_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's a difficult route.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Aaargh! Rhodes Island!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's an ambush! Watch out!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog",
        "fadetime": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
