        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1",
        "name2": "char_012_misa_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Madam...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "text": "There are some Infected kids... still in the slums.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "text": "If possible...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "text": "I hope that you can take care of them...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1",
        "name2": "char_012_misa_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Our duty is to protect Lungmen.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Infected are not considered citizens of Lungmen.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1",
        "name2": "char_012_misa_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1",
        "name2": "char_012_misa_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "However, citizens or not, the Infected still belong to Lungmen.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "I have no obligation to promise you anything, but I will perform my duty.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "After all...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1",
        "name2": "char_012_misa_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "They said they used to...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "text": "=",
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1",
        "name2": "char_012_misa_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "It's something we've always been doing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1",
        "name2": "char_012_misa_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thank you...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1",
        "name2": "char_012_misa_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you know why we've been searching for you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1",
        "name2": "char_012_misa_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...I'm not sure.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can't think of any reason why you'd want me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "text": "But I have a feeling...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "text": "That this isn't about me...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "text": "...It's about my parents.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1",
        "name2": "char_012_misa_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...Yes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your father was the most famous scientist in Chernobog.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "As well as one of the most important political figures there.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "Perhaps, there's something you might know...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "But even if that isn't the case...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "We cannot allow you to fall into Reunion's hands.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
